and how they priced
those computers at cost,

00:41:26.850 --> 00:41:30.190
and provided those 60,000,

00:41:30.190 --> 00:41:34.954
and then we put in about
$25 million to do that.

00:41:34.954 --> 00:41:38.410
We're able to get them and
provide them education.

00:41:38.410 --> 00:41:41.740
But it just highlights the differences

00:41:41.740 --> 00:41:46.740
in the conditions between
the different populations

00:41:47.280 --> 00:41:50.390
and basic things like
education or computers.

00:41:50.390 --> 00:41:52.330
So, yeah, we're thrilled to do that,

00:41:52.330 --> 00:41:56.803
hopefully together with what
wonderful work you're doing.

00:41:58.352 --> 00:42:01.010
- No, I'm talking to a
lot of folks these days,

00:42:01.010 --> 00:42:03.770
and Khan Academy, as much as we hope

00:42:03.770 --> 00:42:04.900
it can help a lot of folks,

00:42:04.900 --> 00:42:07.440
you need that device access,
you need that internet access.

00:42:07.440 --> 00:42:09.150
So the work that y'all
are doing in Connecticut

00:42:09.150 --> 00:42:11.510
is incredible, and we're hoping

00:42:11.510 --> 00:42:13.730
it can set an example
for many other groups

00:42:13.730 --> 00:42:15.630
around the country or the world.

00:42:15.630 --> 00:42:17.210
So, Ray, thank you so much.

00:42:17.210 --> 00:42:18.930
I hope you can join the,

00:42:18.930 --> 00:42:20.620
we have so many questions
that I didn't get to.

00:42:20.620 --> 00:42:22.340
I probably got to 5% of the questions

00:42:22.340 --> 00:42:23.560
that people are asking.

00:42:23.560 --> 00:42:25.680
I, personally, would also
like to go much deeper

00:42:25.680 --> 00:42:27.480
on some of these economic questions

00:42:27.480 --> 00:42:29.610
to make sure I understand
it a little bit better.

00:42:29.610 --> 00:42:31.290
But thank you so much for joining today,

00:42:31.290 --> 00:42:33.850
and I hope we can do
this again sometime soon.

00:42:33.850 --> 00:42:36.200
- It was a delight, anytime you want.

00:42:36.200 --> 00:42:37.150
Look forward to it.

00:42:39.880 --> 00:42:41.390
- Thanks, Ray.

00:42:41.390 --> 00:42:43.660
So thanks everyone for joining today.

00:42:43.660 --> 00:42:45.340
This was a great conversation.

00:42:45.340 --> 00:42:46.990
Thanks for all of your questions.

00:42:48.113 --> 00:42:50.620
I think we will be able to
convince Ray to join again

00:42:50.620 --> 00:42:53.120
